WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.850
<v Mara>They are afraid of your gun.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.120
<v Urban>They are afraid of the man who can afford it.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.420
<v Mara>Then do not go to him.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.020
<v Urban>A design unfired is a corpse with clean hands.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.980
<v Mara>And a design fired?

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:14.820
<v Urban>Work.
